prompts.prompt:
Find the bug and fix it. This Go code sometimes deadlocks under load:

```go
type Pool struct {
	mu    sync.Mutex
	conns []*Conn
	cond  *sync.Cond
}

func (p *Pool) Get() *Conn {
	p.mu.Lock()
	if len(p.conns) == 0 {
		p.cond.Wait()
	}
	c := p.conns[len(p.conns)-1]
	p.conns = p.conns[:len(p.conns)-1]
	p.mu.Unlock()
	return c
}

func (p *Pool) Put(c *Conn) {
	p.mu.Lock()
	p.conns = append(p.conns, c)
	p.mu.Unlock()
	p.cond.Signal()
}
```

(p.cond is created with sync.NewCond(&p.mu).) Explain every problem you see, not just one.
